# ==============================================================================
# Notes
# ==============================================================================
# - .results/ is the ONLY current runtime root.
# - .resultss/ is legacy/obsolete and must not return to source control.
# - myinfo/ is local user state and can include MAC addresses or a large OUI DB.
# - Markdown analysis reports stored inside .results/ are intentionally ignored.
# - Source and repository documentation remain visible to Git.
